{
  "id": "E289",
  "title": "Better Safe Than Sorry",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-01-06",
  "synopsis": "How come Chinese people are afraid of “one in ten thousand”?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/944/8dc6f956f88e3ca2e6f3eca41d7a0f98d3ad1c0d.mp3?1546098029",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "不怕一万，就怕万一 \n\n丽丽：你出门的时候带一把伞吧。今天可能会下雨。\n安妮：不用了，今天天气这么好，不会下雨的。\n丽丽：最好还是带着吧。不怕一万，就怕万一。\n安妮：万一是谁？为什么要害怕他？\n丽丽：“一万”是说事情一定会发生，“万一”是说事情发生的可能性只有万分之一。我的意思是让你做好准备。\n安妮：好吧。你说得对！我还是带上伞吧。",
    "traditional": "不怕一萬，就怕萬一 \n\n麗麗：你出門的時候帶一把傘吧。今天可能會下雨。\n安妮：不用了，今天天氣這麼好，不會下雨的。\n麗麗：最好還是帶著吧。不怕一萬，就怕萬一。\n安妮：萬一是誰？為什麼要害怕他？\n麗麗：“一萬”是說事情一定會發生，“萬一”是說事情發生的可能性只有萬分之一。我的意思是讓你做好準備。\n安妮：好吧。你說得對！我還是帶上傘吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Better Safe Than Sorry"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你出门的时候带一把伞吧。今天可能会下雨。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你出門的時候帶一把傘吧。今天可能會下雨。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ chū mén de shí hou dài yì bǎ sǎn ba jīn tiān kě néng huì xià yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Bring your umbrella when you go out. It might rain today."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：不用了，今天天气这么好，不会下雨的。",
      "traditional": "安妮：不用了，今天天氣這麼好，不會下雨的。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī bú yòng le jīn tiān tiān qì zhè me hǎo bú huì xià yǔ de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: No need. The weather is great today. It won’t rain."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：最好还是带着吧。不怕一万，就怕万一。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：最好還是帶著吧。不怕一萬，就怕萬一。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zuì hǎo hái shi dài zhe ba bú pà yí wàn jiù pà wàn yī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: You’d still better bring it. It’s better to be safe than sorry."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "安妮：万一是谁？为什么要害怕他？",
      "traditional": "安妮：萬一是誰？為什麼要害怕他？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wàn yī shì shéi wèi shén me yào hài pà tā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Who is “Wanyi”? Why should we be afraid of him?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：“一万”是说事情一定会发生，",
      "traditional": "麗麗：“一萬”是說事情一定會發生，",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yí wàn shì shuō shì qing yí dìng huì fā shēng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "“万一”是说事情发生的可能性只有万分之一。",
      "traditional": "“萬一”是說事情發生的可能性只有萬分之一。",
      "pinyin": "wàn yī shì shuō shì qing fā shēng de kě néng xìng zhǐ yǒu wàn fēn zhī yī",
      "english": "Lili: “Ten thousand” means things that will definitely happen."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "我的意思是让你做好准备。",
      "traditional": "我的意思是讓你做好準備。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de yì si shì ràng nǐ zuò hǎo zhǔn bèi",
      "english": "“One in ten thousand” means something that only has a probability of happening once in ten thousand times."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m saying that you should be prepared."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：好吧。你说得对！我还是带上伞吧。",
      "traditional": "安妮：好吧。你說得對！我還是帶上傘吧。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī hǎo ba nǐ shuō de duì wǒ hái shi dài shàng sǎn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Alright, you are right! I’ll bring an umbrella after all."
    }
  ],
